	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type `prreview` to open review history, or `prreview 123` to open a PR by number. Select a round to read its report.

Press ⌘↩ to review or ⌘⇧↩ to re-review. ⌘O opens the T3 thread. ⌘⇧C copies the displayed findings.

To start from a selected GitHub PR link, press ⌘/ and choose Review or re-review PR.

Review actions can post verified inline comments as you. Configure the GitHub repository, T3 checkout, and any reference documents in Alfred before running.
</string>
